    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Sky Fields: Goober Gardens</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where whimsy meets strategy! Sky Fields: Goober Gardens is a unique, cozy creature collector within Sky Fields. Focused upon raising and nurturing Goobers, Sky Fields: Goober Gardens is a tranquil sanctuary for players to breed, feed and raise Goobers. Sky Fields: Goober Gardens boasts an array of biomes providing different environments for Goobers to grow as you progress in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.poster.avif?t=1749721886\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.webm?t=1749721886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and care for your Goobers\u2014feed them exotic fruits, keep them happy, and help them grow into strong adults. Fuse them to pass down stats, abilities, and unique looks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and encounter Goobers through the array of biomes as you progress. With 4,096 types to discover\u2014including rare Angel, Hellish, and Golden Goobers\u2014build your dream Goober squad and explore endless breeding possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/0c9c4d1abb18e857140b31eb740c937f.avif?t=1749721886\" data-has-big width=800 height=295 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for the travelling merchant, who appears periodically. Exchange your resources for gold and use it to purchase Items and Goobers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your hardy Goobers to defend your island from hostile travellers and their team...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Sky Fields: Goober Gardens</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where whimsy meets strategy! Sky Fields: Goober Gardens is a unique, cozy creature collector within Sky Fields. Focused upon raising and nurturing Goobers, Sky Fields: Goober Gardens is a tranquil sanctuary for players to breed, feed and raise Goobers. Sky Fields: Goober Gardens boasts an array of biomes providing different environments for Goobers to grow as you progress in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.poster.avif?t=1749721886\" width=615 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/dbad35b1e0af2b8431ad0cdd5153fe88.webm?t=1749721886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and care for your Goobers\u2014feed them exotic fruits, keep them happy, and help them grow into strong adults. Fuse them to pass down stats, abilities, and unique looks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and encounter Goobers through the array of biomes as you progress. With 4,096 types to discover\u2014including rare Angel, Hellish, and Golden Goobers\u2014build your dream Goober squad and explore endless breeding possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675950/extras/0c9c4d1abb18e857140b31eb740c937f.avif?t=1749721886\" data-has-big width=800 height=295 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for the travelling merchant, who appears periodically. Exchange your resources for gold and use it to purchase Items and Goobers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your hardy Goobers to defend your island from hostile travellers and their team...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
